* Signed ALB input capacitance cancellation
Vinput d 0 PULSE(0 5 2n 1n 1n 70n 150n)
.model DRV d_logic_block family="HC" input_load=0 out_res=1000 out_delay=1n def="out[0]=in[0];"
.model PLUS d_logic_block family="HC" input_load=4p out_res_pos=-100 out_res_neg=100 out_delay=1n def="out[0]=in[0];"
.model MINUS d_logic_block family="HC" input_load=-2p out_res_pos=-100 out_res_neg=100 out_delay=1n def="out[0]=in[0];"
.model CONTROL d_logic_block family="HC" input_load=2p out_res_pos=-100 out_res_neg=100 out_delay=1n def="out[0]=in[0];"
Aprod [d] [p] DRV
Aprod2 [d] [r] DRV
Aplus [p] [q1] PLUS
Aminus [p] [q2] MINUS
Acontrol [r] [q3] CONTROL
R1 q1 0 100k
R2 q2 0 100k
R3 q3 0 100k
.PRINT TRAN V(q1) V(q2) V(q3)
.tran 5p 130n 0 5p
.end
